airconv: hull shaders from vkd3d-shader (Wine's D3DCompile, used by games that compile HLSL at run
time) index the input control points with vOutputControlPointID directly, not with a temp register.
The relative index decoder only knew temps and crashed the converter (D3D11 and D3D12 tessellation).
Pipeline compile errors that are not UnsupportedFeature keep their message.

